  (generator "open_saeco_generator")
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "6-lead THT DIP, 7.62 mm (300 mil) rows, for a phototriac that straddles the primary/SELV barrier. A 2 mm milled slot runs between the rows and 3.5 mm past the end pins, so the surface path from one row to the other goes around it (about 9 mm) while the air gap between the pads stays at 6.02 mm. Pads and 3D model as KiCad's DIP-6_W7.62mm.")
